      During the year ended March 31, 
      2022, the Company had completed its initial public offer ("IPO") of 
      15,67,29,745 equity shares of face value of Rs. 1 each at an issue price 
      of Rs. 230 per share (including share premium of Rs. 229 per share). The 
      Company had received an amount of Rs. 3,506.02 Crores from IPO net of 
      discount offered to eligible employees and actual IPO 
    expenses.
    
